  "description": "〽️🦍🛡️ - Gorilla Wizards - 〽️🦍🛡️\n- Main outpost in the lands of IdleMMO.\n\nFor Membership Consideration:\n\n- Active\n- Good &amp; Friendly\n- Combat Level 60+\n\n___\n\nCurrent Status:\n\n- Largely on Hiatus\n- Teleport central to map in Eldoria\n\n___\n\nPrior Daily Schedule:\n\n- Raid &amp; Assault - 13:00 UTC\n     - Paused during events\n     - Level 92 Raid Mon and Tues\n     - Level 80 Raid Wed and Thurs\n     - Assault Fri, Sat, and Sun\n- Energizing Pool - With Assault or ~5 Mins before Raid End\n\n___\n\nOur Guidelines:\n- Don&#039;t be a jerk inside or outside of the guild.  Community is more important to us than making every raid.\n- This is a game, have fun and play it how you like.\n- No activity for a period of time is our signal you&#039;ve likely left the game.\n- Contribute in some way.  Making raids, donating materials, helping Recruiting, etc.\n\n___\n\nGuild Discord:\n- As in-game comms are limited, we strongly encourage joining our discord server\n- discord.gg/9qurPnfvkb\n\n___\n\nAccomplishments:\n- Day 1 Guild - March 6, 2024\n- 19th Guild to 💯 - March 6, 2025\n- Guild Hall - April 4, 2025",
